  "description": "<p>A starting point for your own Essence20 content: compendiums already set up for Perks, Powers, Roles, Origins, gear, Zord and Transformer features and Threats, a worked example of each kind of field, and a guide - in Foundry - to making items that show up properly in the Compendium Browser and work through the Rules tab. Copy it, rename it, and make it yours.</p>",
